1
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,300
"My Rival and Me"
(Episode 3)

2
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,080
Now you know what to learn

3
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,560
and what not to, right?

4
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:55,640
Stay there.

5
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,520
Don't steal my cigarette.

6
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,680
I'll expose you online!

7
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,360
Sure. I'll help.

8
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,400
Wow! This ship is too good!

9
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:18,520
That phone wallpaper

10
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,200
was your cat from before, right?

11
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,480
So cute.

12
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,800
Crap. I only just started following him.

13
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,600
I shouldn't know that ancient video.

14
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:29,440
Now I really look obsessed
with his body and soul!

15
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:31,800
So you saw it.

16
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,040
Were you more careful

17
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,720
while filming after that?

18
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,320
What do you mean?

19
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,520
I thought you knew.

20
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,920
Knew what, man?

21
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,360
Can you please be clear?

22
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,840
You're giving me a heart attack.

23
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,200
It's nothing.

24
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,280
You sprained your ankle before

25
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:55,800
and posted about it, right?

26
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:58,320
I saw one of my big
fan accounts repost it,

27
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,696
claiming your injury was fake.

28
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:00,960
I was angry.

29
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,520
I thought it went too far.

30
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:05,080
My manager wouldn't let me speak up
directly.

31
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,080
I didn't know you well then,

32
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,920
so I made a video.

33
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,960
When I posted it,

34
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,760
I didn't think you'd see it.

35
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,280
And even if you did,

36
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,280
you wouldn't know what it meant.

37
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,080
Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo,

38
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,920
clearly responding to our Wei Yanzi.

39
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,880
A subtle display of love!

40
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,080
What's wrong?

41
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,280
Nothing.

42
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,640
I've just had too much sweetness.

43
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,240
I'm about to get diabetes.

44
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,480
What did you say?

45
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,600
I didn't catch that.

46
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:51,840
This isn't my heart fluttering.

47
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:55,600
It's my heart dropping a sick beat!

48
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,640
Be gentle!

49
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:09,240
I make my living with this face.

50
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,200
So you do remember.

51
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,240
I thought you'd become a stunt double.

52
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,400
It's not like I haven't done that before.

53
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,840
Enough.

54
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,080
I'm going home.

55
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:41,680
Now it's your turn to help me.

56
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,680
Cheng Yan,

57
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:46,440
can you stop trying to do it everywhere?

58
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,760
I'm injured!

59
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,560
It's your face that's injured.

60
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,120
He kicked your ass too?

61
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:51,520
You...

62
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,320
Hey!

63
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:53,040
Hey!

64
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,280
Cheng Yan, have you no humanity? What are
you doing?

65
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,000
I want...

66
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,680
Why are you in such a hurry?

67
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,440
What's the rush?

68
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,680
I need to get back and drink some tea.

69
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,120
Time to restore my health.

70
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,120
You like tea too?

71
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:05,840
Huh?

72
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:06,920
White tea,

73
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,400
green tea,

74
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,640
Longjing?

75
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:11,720
What's your favorite?

76
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:12,840
I'll get you a box.

77
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,960
No, that's okay.

78
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Gu Yiliang!

79
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:22,120
My ship was sailing, and now he's revealed
a girlfriend!

80
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,520
This is my mom.

81
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Hello, Mom.

82
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,840
I need to flee the scene.

83
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:35,640
Didn't you need to get back for tea?

84
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:40,000
Thanks. Yes, it's getting cold.

85
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,480
I'll leave you two to talk.

86
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:47,080
You don't answer my messages.

87
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:49,000
I have to come yell at you in person.

88
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,120
How could someone be so low.

89
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,080
Didn't I just give you 300,000 yuan?

90
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,160
How is 300,000 enough?

91
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,720
You think I'm a beggar?

92
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,960
At least 30 million!

93
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,680
I don't have it.

94
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,320
Then find someone to keep you!

95
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:10,400
Your dad and I raised you all these years.

96
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,320
What's wrong with contributing to the
family?

97
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,160
Don't forget you owe your brother too.

98
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,360
If you refuse,

99
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,240
I'll expose all the filthy things

100
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,400
you've done.

101
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,720
I'll ruin your precious celebrity career.

102
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,120
Ma'am,

103
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,000
that's way out of line.

104
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,160
Who are you?

105
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,720
I'm his mother.

106
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,600
Stepmother.

107
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,080
Stepmother?

108
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,000
That explains it.

109
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,280
Stepmothers in dramas

110
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,960
are never any good.

111
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,760
What did you say?

112
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,720
You keep going on about casting couches.

113
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,000
We live under the rule of law.

114
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,920
You're inciting crime, you know?

115
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,760
Crime?

116
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,200
What Gu Yiliang did

117
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,800
deserves worse than a criminal sentence.

118
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:57,840
What did he do?

119
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,800
Fake his degree?

120
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,360
Get roles through shady connections?

121
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,880
Take drugs?

122
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:04,680
Those rumors were debunked ages ago.

123
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,160
Especially the drug allegations.

124
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,520
To fit a role,

125
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,680
he lost ten kilos.

126
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,280
He was forced to a hospital in the dead of
night

127
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,616
for a drug test to prove his innocence.

128
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:15,200
His agency and the crew spoke up for him.

129
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,760
Even the authorities announced

130
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,040
that he'd done nothing wrong.

131
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:19,440
And still,

132
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,800
people slander him.

133
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,040
Why?

134
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,560
Why treat him like that?

135
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,360
Are you his manager?

136
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,360
I'm his partner.

137
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,480
Partner?

138
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,480
His... his rival!

139
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,200
Lady,

140
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,560
is old age affecting your hearing?

141
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,680
You little...

142
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,200
Go back and tell your husband

143
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,520
Gu Yiliang will give him 100,000 yuan a
month.

144
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,600
If I hear you slandering him again,

145
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:53,040
I'll spend your precious
30 million on his PR.

146
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,440
I'll make sure the whole world knows

147
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:57,600
how you've been bleeding him dry.

148
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:01,320
I'll hire the best lawyer to fight you.

149
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,200
I promise you won't get a penny.

150
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,520
Only 100,000?

151
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,560
Who are you to...

152
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:12,280
Shh.

153
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:13,960
Keep talking, and I'll get annoyed.

154
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,960
Woman,

155
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,400
you've successfully made me uncomfortable.

156
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,880
Don't test my limits.

157
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,720
You can't afford the consequences.

158
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,160
Let me tell you,

159
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:32,000
anyone who touches my Gu Yiliang

160
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:35,360
will see their whole world destroyed.

161
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:38,920
The weather's turning cold.

162
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,880
Time for the Gu Group to go bankrupt.

163
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,760
Let's go.

164
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,800
Hey, you two!

165
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,080
Don't worry.

166
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:15,200
It's all right.

167
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:17,360
Yeah.

168
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:18,760
Don't worry.

169
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,120
It's all sorted out.

170
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,000
That's good.

171
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:24,960
About just now,

172
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,080
thank you.

173
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,680
It's nothing.

174
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,560
Then,

175
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,920
how about a smile?

176
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:35,560
Come on.

177
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,240
What am I doing?

178
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,280
Acting out fanfiction?

179
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:49,600
My domineering CEO act was pretty good,
right?

180
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,480
Better than mine.

181
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,920
Just a little party trick.

182
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,200
So, my rival,

183
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:00,880
why do you remember so much about me

184
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,240
and defend me like that?

185
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,960
I remember everything about you.

186
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,040
No!

187
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,760
I... I mean,

188
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,000
I didn't remember it before,

189
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,480
but just now, suddenly,

190
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,000
it all came back.

191
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:18,880
No.

192
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,080
I mean,

193
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,160
I only remember a little.

194
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,440
I'm done. Let the world burn.

195
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,160
Or let me move to another planet.

196
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:28,560
Is being my fan

197
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,000
something to be ashamed of?

198
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,400
Yes, Mr. Gu.

199
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:38,320
I really am your fan.

200
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,720
Then,

201
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,160
Mr. Gu,

202
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,680
could I have your autograph?

203
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:04,680
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

204
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,680
Give me yours too.

205
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:26,920
I should still warn him to prepare some
crisis PR.

206
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,040
But why does seeing him bullied

207
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:31,240
make my heart hurt so much?

208
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,360
A creature this beautiful

209
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,960
could wreak havoc on the world.

210
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,520
I should claim him.

211
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,600
It really is good.

212
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,040
Right?

213
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:40,400
Yeah.

214
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,040
Anyone who touches my Gu Yiliang

215
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:44,200
will see their whole world destroyed.

216
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,320
Let's go.

217
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,920
So, my rival,

218
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,640
why do you remember so much about me

219
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,240
and defend me like that?

220
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,760
I want to ask you the same thing.

221
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,680
Why am I so protective of you,

222
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,320
my rival?

223
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,400
Why ask so many questions?

224
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,560
Shippers are fans too.

225
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:14,760
From now on,

226
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,360
I'm Gu Yiliang's dad fan.

227
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,280
He's such a good person.

228
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,840
Who wouldn't want to be his overprotective
dad?

229
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,560
A dad fan.

230
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,120
Get some herbal tea.

231
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,600
Right.

232
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,200
Just a fan.

233
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:41,800
Stop overthinking.

234
00:11:46,213 --> 00:11:47,699
[Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo]

235
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,320
Your eyes,

236
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,280
your smile,

237
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:53,480
bright as the stars,

238
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,560
gentle as the night breeze,

239
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,680
are the loveliest sights I've ever seen.

240
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,440
Douya, what's my heart rate?

241
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:32,080
182 beats per minute. Too high.

242
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:34,840
Please slow down and cycle gently.

243
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,320
Help me record a diary entry.

244
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,520
My rival stood up for me yesterday.

245
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:46,240
Watching him leave Wang Huanxu speechless,

246
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,080
I felt bubbles in my chest,

247
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:52,000
rising and bursting, one after another.

248
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:56,720
I've realized that no
matter how bad I feel,

249
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,560
as long as he's there,

250
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,000
he can pull me back.

251
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,920
Oh, and

252
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,960
he can't convincingly play anything,

253
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:11,640
except a domineering CEO.

254
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,320
Isn't that adorable?

255
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:19,880
Recorded. That's your
tenth "cute," by the way.

256
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,920
I...

257
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:24,200
Incoming call from Cheng Yan. High
priority.

258
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:30,800
Hello, Mr. Cheng.

259
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,160
It's taken care of.

260
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,400
Oh, thank you.

261
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,840
You're one of our artists.

262
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:37,120
It's our job to protect you.

263
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,680
By the way,

264
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,560
there's a livestream partnership tonight.

265
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,720
You and Wei Yanzi.

266
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:46,480
What partnership is so important

267
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,960
that you have to tell me yourself?

268
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:52,000
Your Weibo interactions have been getting
attention.

269
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,840
Wang Man suggested

270
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,320
you use this chance to do some fanservice.

271
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:57,880
But she thought you might refuse.

272
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,480
I'm sounding you out.

273
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,080
Wouldn't that be bad?

274
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:05,560
It's true, you don't stand to gain much.

275
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:08,000
I meant bad for Wei Yanzi.

276
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,920
His haters are pretty vicious.

277
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,480
I'm afraid he'll get more hate.

278
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,360
The old tree is blooming at last.

279
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:17,640
What?

280
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,280
Apparently not.

281
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,640
Wei Yanzi has lots of haters,

282
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,040
but devoted fans too.

283
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:27,440
Some fanservice could broaden his fanbase.

284
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:28,520
Suit yourself.

285
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:37,240
What's your favorite line?

286
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:42,560
Who are you pairing up? I'll do it.

287
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,000
You?

288
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:45,800
Yeah.

289
