404
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:28,840
5,000 MMR in Dota.

405
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:29,680
Ask him about teaming up.

406
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,760
Master tier in League.

407
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:32,160
All challengers welcome.

408
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:36,360
Yanzi.

409
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:38,640
Yanzi.

410
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:39,680
Sorry, everyone.

411
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:40,840
My assistant needs me.

412
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,400
Chat with Mr. Gu for a bit.

413
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:43,760
I'll be right back.

414
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:49,016
You're selling that bromance so
professionally,

415
