A little.

442
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:47,000
But we're usually in bed by one or two.

443
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:49,320
Wait. That sounded ambiguous.

444
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:51,840
Styling?

445
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,640
What do we think of our looks?

446
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:56,760
My overall palette is blue-gray.

447
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,840
Yes. It goes with my brick red.

448
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:05,320
