456
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,200
Come on.

457
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:20,680
Come on.

458
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,440
Fine, I'll lift you.

459
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,080
