relationship.

467
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:20,440
I want

468
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:21,440
What do you want?

469
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,480
You think you're about to get famous,

470
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:27,480
