471
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:29,560
Is that it?

472
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:37,080
Too bad.

473
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,240
Nobody else is as generous as I am,

474
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:43,200
