475
00:22:57,680 --> 00:23:00,520
I brought this on myself. Why complain?

476
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:03,400
Put up with it. Think of it as a job.

477
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:19,040
Mr. Cheng,

478
00:23:19,280 --> 00:23:21,360
Mr. Zhu still hasn't signed his management
contract.

479
00:23:23,320 --> 00:23:24,320
I know.

480
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:26,080
He's too lazy to read it. I'll remind him.

481
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:28,680
But I hear he's talking to another
production company.

482
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:32,600
Did that nomination make
him too good for Hengtu?

483
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:54,880
Are you angry?

484
00:23:55,040 --> 00:23:56,120
I'm sorry.

485
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,720
Everything before was my fault.

486
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:03,080
This is how you apologize?

487
