You said I never took the initiative to
help.

488
00:24:10,800 --> 00:24:11,800
Get out.

489
00:24:12,800 --> 00:24:14,000
What do you mean, Cheng Yan?

490
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:15,120
What's wrong with you?

491
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:17,120
Get out.

492
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:35,440
How can he compete to be
the straightest one second,

493
00:24:41,360 --> 00:24:46,640
then tumble into my arms with that loving
smile the next?

494
00:24:47,280 --> 00:24:48,280
Washed and ready.

495
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:49,800
Thanks.

496
00:24:51,440 --> 00:24:53,560
Are you upset about the livestream?

497
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:56,360
