all.

498
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:57,680
No!

499
00:24:57,840 --> 00:24:59,280
How could I be angry with you?

500
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,400
Wait.

501
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:05,080
You knew they wanted us to do fanservice?

502
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,480
Of course.

503
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:19,120
