509
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:33,520
Then tell me,

510
00:25:34,120 --> 00:25:36,040
why do you keep switching
between coy and flirty?

511
00:25:37,120 --> 00:25:39,160
I wanted to take it slowly,

512
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,640
but you weren't playing along.

513
00:25:43,280 --> 00:25:44,920
I was just going to call you Yanzi

514
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,320
and share a peach.

515
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:47,520
That would've done the job.

516
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,600
I wasn't playing along?

517
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:51,320
That was taking it slowly?

518
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,440
You nearly scared me to death!

519
00:25:54,360 --> 00:25:55,520
What's there to be scared of?

520
00:25:56,400 --> 00:25:58,720
Is doing fanservice with me that
unpleasant?

521
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,160
You don't understand.

522
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,480
You're a good actor.

523
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:03,360
You've got real talent.

524
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:04,936
You don't need to worry about that stuff.

525
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:05,800
You and I doing fanservice

526
