If it goes badly, I get all the abuse.

530
00:26:14,560 --> 00:26:16,720
All we do is give them a little spark.

531
00:26:16,840 --> 00:26:19,360
The fans imagine the rest.

532
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:22,160
There's nothing wrong with our
interactions.

533
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:23,640
Don't overthink it.

534
00:26:26,600 --> 00:26:29,000
I guess that's true.

535
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,120
Then it's settled.

536
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,200
Don't worry.

537
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,880
I promised to teach you acting.

538
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:40,160
We'll work on it together.

539
00:26:41,280 --> 00:26:42,280
Okay.

540
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,320
Just like that,

541
00:26:47,320 --> 00:26:49,440
Gu Yiliang and I are fanservice partners.

542
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,560
Not bad.

543
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:52,600
Acting lessons and shipping at the same
time.

544
00:27:02,520 --> 00:27:03,680
I can't eat any more.

545
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:06,320
You know,

546
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:08,360
