564
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,480
Hello.

565
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,200
I'm settling in well.

566
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:01,920
Everything's going smoothly. No problems.

567
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:04,680
I'm not tired.

568
00:28:04,760 --> 00:28:06,200
It's just filming a show.

569
00:28:07,800 --> 00:28:09,320
I've got enough money.

570
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:11,560
You're not "keeping" some freeloader.

571
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,440
I earn my own money too.

572
00:28:13,880 --> 00:28:15,840
Please smoke less.

573
00:28:16,080 --> 00:28:17,320
Stop making me worry.

574
00:28:22,840 --> 00:28:23,560
Girls,

575
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:25,776
Lan Jue announced Wei the dog's playing
the second lead.

576
00:28:25,800 --> 00:28:28,240
He timed it to leech off Yiliang's stills.

577
00:28:28,360 --> 00:28:29,480
Boost our numbers, everyone.

578
00:28:29,560 --> 00:28:30,800
Don't let his fans overtake us.

579
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:34,566
Wei the dog's lifeless acting,
and he still gets cast?

580
00:28:34,973 --> 00:28:38,443
So
the rumor about his sugar daddy Huang was
true!

581
00:28:39,233 --> 00:28:40,993
Disgusting.

582
00:28:47,640 --> 00:28:48,920
No way.

583
00:28:49,840 --> 00:28:51,720
Just take better care of yourself.

584
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:56,480
Don't come. It won't look good.

585
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:02,360
Have you made any friends?

586
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,160
I have.

587
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:09,880
He's really good to me.

588
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:13,480
Don't worry about a thing.

589
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:14,480
Who am I?

590
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:17,440
I'm Huang Qianlong's son!

591
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:29,840
Douya,

592
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:32,706
I think my rival has a sugar daddy.

593
00:29:32,883 --> 00:29:36,403
Is that so? Seems you're not
the only one who finds him cute.

594
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:37,720
Shut up.

595
00:29:37,800 --> 00:29:39,200
He's not that kind of person.

596
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,400
Although

597
00:29:42,120 --> 00:29:43,520
he really is rather cute.

598
00:29:44,360 --> 00:29:45,360
Oh, come on!

599
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,800
That's not the point.

600
00:29:47,320 --> 00:29:49,760
We just agreed to promote our ship.

601
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:54,120
If it's true,

602
00:29:55,040 --> 00:29:56,400
what will happen to him?

603
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:59,680
You should consider yourself first.

604
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,960
If his career collapses,

605
00:30:01,960 --> 00:30:05,440
you could be dragged down as his
"partner."

606
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:07,200
His career...

607
00:30:08,800 --> 00:30:09,800
Right.

608
00:30:11,040 --> 00:30:12,720
I have to protect his career.

609
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,240
Got it.

610
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:15,400
Yeah.

611
00:30:15,560 --> 00:30:16,560
Okay.

612
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,080
Gu Yiliang.

613
00:30:20,600 --> 00:30:21,680
Why are you standing there?

614
00:30:21,880 --> 00:30:22,880
Let's go.

615
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:28,720
Yeah.

616
00:30:29,080 --> 00:30:30,080
Okay.

617
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:39,120
What's wrong with Gu Yiliang?

618
00:30:39,280 --> 00:30:42,120
He just bragged he'd join me for every
meal.

619
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:44,280
Now he's ignoring me.

620
00:30:45,040 --> 00:30:47,800
One phone call, and he's abandoning me?

621
00:30:48,320 --> 00:30:50,600
That jerk is playing with my feelings!

622
00:30:52,200 --> 00:30:53,600
Gu Yiliang.

623
00:30:55,765 --> 00:31:00,005
No way, did our ship sank
before we even launched it?

624
00:31:00,051 --> 00:31:01,051
Gu Yiliang,

625
00:31:01,215 --> 00:31:05,815
you keep toying with me, over and over
again!

626
00:31:05,839 --> 00:31:08,319
No. I refuse.

627
00:31:09,680 --> 00:31:10,680
Gu Yiliang.

628
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:18,040
Gu Yiliang.

629
00:31:18,080 --> 00:31:19,400
Gu Yiliang! Gu...

630
00:31:20,840 --> 00:31:21,840
Watch where you're going.

631
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:25,240
That familiar flirting. It's definitely Gu
Yiliang.

632
00:31:25,320 --> 00:31:27,160
No body-swapping here.

633
00:31:37,800 --> 00:31:38,800
When we get back,

634
00:31:39,040 --> 00:31:40,400
let's rehearse properly

635
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:43,760
and work on your acting.

636
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:45,560
Oh.

637
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:46,920
Become a real talent,

638
00:31:49,080 --> 00:31:50,640
and you'll land more roles.

639
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:54,400
A bright future ahead!

640
00:31:56,280 --> 00:31:57,440
I...

641
00:31:57,680 --> 00:31:59,200
I'm serious.

642
00:31:59,760 --> 00:32:01,040
Stop playing the comic sidekick.

643
00:32:01,760 --> 00:32:04,640
Is he unhappy with my acting?

644
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:06,440
Does he think I'm not good enough,

645
00:32:06,520 --> 00:32:08,080
so, in the spirit of mutual prosperity,

646
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:11,720
he's training me to be his worthy
fanservice partner?

647
00:32:15,080 --> 00:32:16,520
You're so good to me.

648
00:32:19,520 --> 00:32:20,920
You don't look down on me.

649
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,840
Does he look down on me?

650
00:32:39,946 --> 00:32:41,506
Or doesn't he?

651
00:32:47,320 --> 00:32:48,800
I love you,

652
00:32:48,880 --> 00:32:51,240
my darling girl.

653
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:53,000
When I see you,

654
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:55,480
my heart starts racing.

655
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:00,960
How long

656
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:02,680
have you been like this?

657
00:33:02,880 --> 00:33:05,880
Bad acting is something you're born with.

658
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:09,560
I've been like this since I started.

659
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:12,280
Aren't you afraid of what people say?

660
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:14,160
Let them talk.

661
00:33:14,280 --> 00:33:15,400
I'm used to it.

662
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:19,480
Do many people know?

663
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:22,720
Isn't it obvious to everyone?

664
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,560
You know too, don't you?

665
00:33:29,480 --> 00:33:30,480
What's wrong?

666
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:32,160
What's wrong?

667
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:34,840
Can't you stop doing this?

668
00:33:35,320 --> 00:33:37,960
Does he not want to promote our ship?

669
00:33:38,040 --> 00:33:41,760
One minute he does, the next he doesn't.
What is this?

670
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:44,080
But for the great Niangzi cause,

671
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:45,400
I can't let you go either.

672
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:48,960
Sure.

673
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:51,440
I've got you now, don't I?

674
00:33:53,280 --> 00:33:56,000
That's right. He's got me now.

675
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,320
What's wrong?

676
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:03,400
Huh?

677
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:06,160
Why did you put it out with your fingers?

678
00:34:15,879 --> 00:34:17,366
Bonus Content 3: Gu Yiliang on set

679
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,480
How's filming going?

680
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:27,480
Something came up.

681
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:30,320
We invested in Director Lu's new show.

682
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:32,560
It was meant to start in two weeks,

683
00:34:33,240 --> 00:34:34,920
but the male lead got caught in a scandal.

684
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:37,880
It'll probably break in the next day or
two.

685
00:34:38,560 --> 00:34:39,800
Director Lu and I discussed it,

686
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,000
and we'd like you to fill in.

687
00:34:42,600 --> 00:34:43,640
That's too rushed.

688
00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:45,200
I haven't even read the script.

689
00:34:45,640 --> 00:34:46,640
I can't take it.

690
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:50,480
Going straight into another production

691
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:52,240
might affect my performance too.

692
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:53,800
I'd like a break.

693
00:34:57,120 --> 00:34:58,160
It is rather rushed.

694
00:34:58,880 --> 00:34:59,880
And

695
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:01,800
Wei Yanzi is in it too.

696
00:35:02,600 --> 00:35:03,960
If you join,

697
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:06,720
it could spark unnecessary fan wars.

698
00:35:10,040 --> 00:35:11,400
You mean "Lan Jue?"

699
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:25,160
Actually,

700
00:35:26,160 --> 00:35:27,680
a week to learn the lines

701
00:35:28,040 --> 00:35:29,440
and a week to find the character...

702
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:30,560
The timing's perfect.

703
00:35:31,720 --> 00:35:34,040
And I think I'm in pretty good form.

704
00:35:34,120 --> 00:35:35,120
Don't you?

705
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,480
So your sudden change of heart

706
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:42,320
is because of Wei Yanzi?

707
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:47,520
So you invested in this show

708
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:49,600
because Mr. Zhu's playing the villain?

709
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:52,480
Who's Mr. Zhu?

710
00:35:52,960 --> 00:35:53,960
I don't know him.

711
00:35:54,720 --> 00:35:55,960
I'm just in it for the money.

712
00:35:58,240 --> 00:36:00,120
I do know Wei Yanzi,

713
00:36:01,280 --> 00:36:02,440
but my only reason

714
00:36:02,720 --> 00:36:03,840
is my love of work.
